{"book":"isaiah","lang":"en","model":"glm-5.2","timestamp":"2026-07-23T08:16:59.014017985Z","verse":13,"ref":"isaiah 10:13","tier":"glm-5.2","chapter":10,"translation":"For he said, 'By the strength of my hand I have done ⟨it⟩, and by my wisdom, for I ⟨am⟩ prudent; I removed the boundaries of peoples, and ⟨their⟩ treasures I plundered, and I brought down ⟨those⟩ dwelling ⟨like⟩ a mighty one.'","tokens":[{"surface":"כי","gloss":"For"},{"surface":"אמר","gloss":"he said"},{"surface":"בכח","gloss":"By the strength"},{"surface":"ידי","gloss":"of my hand"},{"surface":"עשיתי","gloss":"I have done"},{"surface":"ובחכמתי","gloss":"and by my wisdom"},{"surface":"כי","gloss":"for"},{"surface":"נבנותי","gloss":"I have understanding"},{"surface":"ואסיר","gloss":"I removed"},{"surface":"גבולת","gloss":"the boundaries"},{"surface":"עמים","gloss":"of peoples"},{"surface":"ועתידתיהם","gloss":"and their treasures"},{"surface":"שושתי","gloss":"I plundered"},{"surface":"ואוריד","gloss":"and I brought down"},{"surface":"כאביר","gloss":"like a mighty one"},{"surface":"יושבים","gloss":"dwelling"}]}